    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "I love Italian! I heard about the new restaurant in town, is it open tonight? What's their menu like?",
      "created_at": "2026-10-02T15:45:29.951061+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Yeah, they are! I just arrived and can't wait to try them. Can you tell me more about the menu and their special dishes?",
      "created_at": "2026-10-02T15:47:06.641520+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "I love it when they have a live DJ!",
      "created_at": "2026-10-02T15:50:18.342608+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Oh, that sounds like a great place! I'll definitely check it out tonight. What about the vibe they have going on? Do you think there will be any live music performances?",
      "created_at": "2026-10-02T15:51:32.594856+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Thanks so much, I'm actually really excited about going!",
      "created_at": "2026-10-02T16:00:17.596020+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "I'm really excited about going, but what time does it open? I want to check the menu first.",
      "created_at": "2026-10-02T16:01:38.404192+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Thank you so much, I'm really looking forward to it!",
      "created_at": "2026-10-02T16:03:14.496188+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Thank you so much for the information, I really appreciate it. You're welcome!",
      "created_at": "2026-10-02T16:05:26.904038+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "I'm really looking forward to it! I think going will be amazing. What do you have in mind for the date?",
      "created_at": "2026-10-02T16:07:55.924911+00:00"
    },
    {
